    {"type":"text","id":"summary_text","x":65,"y":1693,"width":1610,"height":115,"text":"Tóm tắt cả 2 connections\nC1 Laptop↔Bastion: Laptop → IGW → facing NACL IN(22) → bastion-SG IN(22) → Bastion. Response auto-allow ở SG.\nC2 Bastion↔Private EC2: Bastion → bastion-SG OUT(22) → facing NACL OUT(22) → public RT → VPC router → service NACL IN(22) → service-SG IN(22) → Private EC2.\nResponse C2: service-SG OUT(auto) → service NACL OUT(45678) → VPC router → facing NACL IN(45678) → bastion-SG IN(auto).","originalText":"Tóm tắt cả 2 connections\nC1 Laptop↔Bastion: Laptop → IGW → facing NACL IN(22) → bastion-SG IN(22) → Bastion. Response auto-allow ở SG.\nC2 Bastion↔Private EC2: Bastion → bastion-SG OUT(22) → facing NACL OUT(22) → public RT → VPC router → service NACL IN(22) → service-SG IN(22) → Private EC2.\nResponse C2: service-SG OUT(auto) → service NACL OUT(45678) → VPC router → facing NACL IN(45678) → bastion-SG IN(auto).","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#22c55e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":370003,"version":1,"versionNonce":370004,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25}
